              "text": "पहली मुलाक़ात में मीरा थोड़ा सकुचाई। pahlī mulāqāt meṁ Mīrā thoṛā sakucāī. At the first meeting Mira was a little shy and held back."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (she …): वह सकुचाई, vah sakucāī."
            }
          ]
        },
