              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सकुचाना (sakucānā) is inherited: CDIAL lists Hindi sakucnā, \"to shrink, become narrow or tight\", under Sanskrit saṁkucyatē, \"shrinks\" (CDIAL 12824); sakucānā is its common form for a person who shrinks back out of shyness."
            }
          ]
